{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：百威亚太业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">百威亚太<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>业绩呈现明显的区域分化。中国区销量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.7%</span>，较一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.5%</span>的降幅显著扩大，而韩国区在低基数效应下实现低双位数销量增长，区域EBITDA同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.3%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在最新研报中下调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>亚太西部EBITDA增长预期至-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.0%</span>，同时上调亚太东部至+5.7%，整体cc EBITDA预期下调1.9%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份研报的核心判断是：中国区仍处于研究模式，管理层试图稳定销量下滑，但短期内难以看到趋势性<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。维持Market-Perform评级，并基于中国区持续仍在调整和原材料成本仍在调整，将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年cc EBITDA预期下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.3%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVRSqmXslopbybJJ64YbwQibHZun9zDjz2kjiaf6Eux0sWVM78ibsTicNo7IcAlVx6bWmn2IAn56O2LvDv72JMK5Y28Z26X63cjTzc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">价格数据与市场变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>中国区销量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.7%</span>，显著差于市场预期。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>指出，除行业整体受不利天气影响外，现饮渠道持续<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>是主因。不过价格组合在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>转为正增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.2%</span>，主要由超高端品类强劲表现驱动，同时居家场景渠道在Corona新包装推动下保持健康增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">cc收入仍下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.6%</span>，亚太西部cc EBITDA同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.5%</span>。报告认为，持续投入居家场景RTM<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>策略以及运营去杠杆是利润率受压的主要原因。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预计下半年亚太西部利润率还将进一步调整100个基点，尽管中国区基数在下半年变得更容易比较，但百威中国与同业之间的增长轨迹差距难以实质性收窄。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 中国区销量降幅从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.5%</span>扩大到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.7%</span>，这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>度比相对降幅更值得关注。价格组合转正说明产品结构升级仍在推进，但量跌的速度快于价升的缓冲能力，导致收入端仍然承压。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVoy1pMST5Lia3ePd3BabzFSmxc1ybIibZ21xsmWTcA0GVQEjRicicdMvLbUB07Mic0BeF714Wr2V6g0PeITJfibelxoUN3sl65p8JXo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">亚太东部是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>最大的亮点。区域EBITDA同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.3%</span>，收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5%</span>，定价叠加运营杠杆推动利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>413个基点。韩国区销量实现低双位数增长，部分原因是去年4月涨价前的出货节奏形成了较低的同比基数。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>提醒，随着<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>涨价影响在下半年完全消化，韩国区的增长轨迹将趋于正常化。报告将亚太东部<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年cc EBITDA增长预期从+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.3%</span>上调至+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.7%</span>，但这一调整更多反映的是基数效应而非趋势性<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUibTV6Ef696eGVtqf9obJh9xoe5BkNd5T89cLsNkjCYYUxRNrCibPwWcdyAUzDPsUHjmHl2yNojNmGmvficHiciaqrIC4iakXhjLIqU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.有效税率业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.3%</span>，表面看与收入下滑形成反差，但拆解后可以发现，主要驱动因素是有效税率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47.6%</span>大幅降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.0%</span>。政府补助降至\"接近零\"的水平，公司表示这一水平将持续。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在模型修订中特别指出，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年EPS预期上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>主要反映低税率和<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">高于预期</span>的净财务成本的综合影响，而非经营层面的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>利润端的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>更多来自税收因素，而非业务基本面。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告显示，百威亚太当前交易价格较历史平均估值低0.8个标准差，相对MSCI中国必需消费指数的折价也低于历史平均水平0.1个标准差。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 07-Bernstein-Budweiser Brewing Co APAC Ltd-1876.HK-Bud APAC Q2- China remains in investment mode as management strive to stabilize the volume decline-260730</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
